Subject: [PATCH 4/4] kbuild: simplify command line creation in scripts/mkmakefile
Date: Tue, 18 Sep 2018 17:45:54 +0900
Message-Id: <1537260354-30082-4-git-send-email-yamada.masahiro@socionext.com>
In-Reply-To: <1537260354-30082-1-git-send-email-yamada.masahiro@socionext.com>
